### List payments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments?page=1&limit=10

### Search payments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments?q=DKPA-1001

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/payments/payments-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "DKPA-1002",
  "booking": "DKB-1002",
  "method": "Card",
  "amount": 249,
  "status": "pending"
}
